{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Privacy Policy | YFAI LTD{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('webStyle/homepage.css') }}">

    <main class="yfai-home yfai-legal-page">
        <section class="yfai-legal" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
            <a class="yfai-legal-home" href="{{ path('home') }}">YF</a>

            <article class="yfai-legal-content">
                <p class="yfai-legal-company">YFAI LTD</p>
                <h1 id="privacy-title">Privacy Policy</h1>

                <p>YFAI LTD respects your privacy.</p>

                <p>This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use and protect personal information when you use YourFragrance.AI and related YFAI services.</p>

                <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
                <p>YFAI LTD is the company responsible for YourFragrance.AI.</p>
                <p>For privacy-related questions, you can contact us at:<br><a href="mailto:privacy@yourfragrance.ai">privacy@yourfragrance.ai</a></p>

                <h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
                <p>We may collect the following information when you use YFAI:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>information you provide through fragrance quizzes or scent preference forms;</li>
                    <li>fragrance preferences, notes, brands, moods, occasions and recommendation inputs;</li>
                    <li>contact information, such as your email address, if you choose to provide it;</li>
                    <li>technical information, such as device type, browser type, IP address and usage data;</li>
                    <li>communication data if you contact us directly.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>3. How we use your information</h2>
                <p>We use your information to:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>provide fragrance recommendations;</li>
                    <li>improve the YFAI scent discovery experience;</li>
                    <li>personalize your results;</li>
                    <li>respond to messages or requests;</li>
                    <li>maintain the security and performance of the website;</li>
                    <li>understand how people use the service;</li>
                    <li>send updates only where you have chosen to receive them.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>4. AI-powered recommendations</h2>
                <p>YFAI may use artificial intelligence and algorithmic matching to interpret scent preferences and generate fragrance recommendations.</p>
                <p>These recommendations are provided for discovery and informational purposes only. They do not guarantee that a fragrance will suit every individual.</p>

                <h2>5. Legal basis</h2>
                <p>Where applicable, we process personal information based on one or more of the following grounds:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>your consent;</li>
                    <li>the performance of a contract or requested service;</li>
                    <li>our legitimate interest in improving and securing the service;</li>
                    <li>compliance with legal obligations.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>6. Sharing your information</h2>
                <p>We do not sell your personal information.</p>
                <p>We may share limited information with trusted service providers who help us operate the website, host the service, analyze usage, or deliver communications.</p>
                <p>These providers are only allowed to use information as necessary to provide their services to YFAI.</p>

                <h2>7. Data retention</h2>
                <p>We keep personal information only for as long as necessary for the purposes described in this Privacy Policy, unless a longer retention period is required by law.</p>

                <h2>8. Your rights</h2>
                <p>Depending on your location, you may have the right to:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>access your personal information;</li>
                    <li>correct inaccurate information;</li>
                    <li>request deletion of your information;</li>
                    <li>object to certain processing;</li>
                    <li>request restriction of processing;</li>
                    <li>request data portability;</li>
                    <li>withdraw consent where processing is based on consent.</li>
                </ul>
                <p>To exercise these rights, contact us at:<br><a href="mailto:privacy@yourfragrance.ai">privacy@yourfragrance.ai</a></p>

                <h2>9. Cookies and analytics</h2>
                <p>YFAI may use cookies or similar technologies to operate the website, improve performance, understand usage and personalize the experience.</p>
                <p>Where required, we will ask for your consent before using non-essential cookies.</p>

                <h2>10. Security</h2>
                <p>We take reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect personal information. However, no online service can be guaranteed to be completely secure.</p>

                <h2>11. Changes to this Privacy Policy</h2>
                <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The latest version will always be available on this page.</p>

                <p class="yfai-legal-updated">Last updated: 19 May 2026</p>
            </article>
        </section>

        {% include 'web/_footer.html.twig' %}
    </main>
{% endblock %}
